// This used to raise a softTODO in DPE
// The error is because the type tree for classes store parameter list arity information,
// but the lifter modifies this information, and the equality is enforced by the middle-end
// flow analysis, which is used by dead param elimination. It would be a pain to change all the
// class symbols because they could be nested in other symbols at an arbitrary depth.
// :fixme
:deadParamElim 
fun f(x) =
  class A(y) with
    fun get = x + y
  new A(2)
